COMMENT     PROVISIONAL REFSEQ: This record has not yet been subject to final
            NCBI review. The reference sequence is identical to Y00514.
            Data kindly reviewed (04-Jul-1989) by Lazarowitz S.G.
            ORFs for 10.9 kd and  26.8 kd proteins correspond to those reported
            for MSV-N and MSV-K both by sequence and position homology;
            overlapping arrangement of ORFs for 31.3 kd and 17.2 kd proteins is
            identical to that reported for MSV-N; ORF for put. 9.7 kd protein
            remains unsure.
            COMPLETENESS: full length.
